{
    "title": "Grubhub for Restaurants",
    "description": "Keep track of orders on your own mobile device with the new Grubhub for Restaurants app. Whether it\u2019s pickup for food delivery, Grubhub for Restaurants will keep you up to date, on the go.\r\n\r\nWhen you join Grubhub, you have a partner that\u2019s committed to helping your business run smoothly. Our new Grubhub for Restaurants mobile app is our newest way of doing just that\u2014with the power of Grubhub right at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nImmediately see all incoming delivery or takeout orders directly on your mobile devices. Whether you\u2019re a brand new restaurant or your city\u2019s go-to, Grubhub for Restaurants is here to help you no matter your size.\r\n\r\nWHY DOWNLOAD THE MOBILE APP?\r\n\r\n\u2022 Never miss an order: Food delivery? Takeout? You name it. Instantly get new order notifications directly to your phone or personal tablet.\r\n\u2022 Take Grubhub with you: Instantly access and manage your Grubhub account whether you\u2019re at the restaurant or busy running errands.\r\n\u2022 Customize your app experience: The app gives you more control and the ability to toggle notifications on your devices.\r\n\u2022 More visibility for your team: Keep your whole management team in the loop with the GFR app on their own devices.\r\n\r\nDownload the app today and keep your restaurant business booming!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Keep track of orders on your own mobile device with the new Grubhub for Restaurants app. Whether it\u2019s pickup for food delivery, Grubhub for Restaurants will keep you up to date, on the go.<br><br>When you join Grubhub, you have a partner that\u2019s committed to helping your business run smoothly. Our new Grubhub for Restaurants mobile app is our newest way of doing just that\u2014with the power of Grubhub right at your fingertips.<br><br>Immediately see all incoming delivery or takeout orders directly on your mobile devices. Whether you\u2019re a brand new restaurant or your city\u2019s go-to, Grubhub for Restaurants is here to help you no matter your size.<br><br>WHY DOWNLOAD THE MOBILE APP?<br><br>\u2022 Never miss an order: Food delivery? Takeout? You name it. Instantly get new order notifications directly to your phone or personal tablet.<br>\u2022 Take Grubhub with you: Instantly access and manage your Grubhub account whether you\u2019re at the restaurant or busy running errands.<br>\u2022 Customize your app experience: The app gives you more control and the ability to toggle notifications on your devices.<br>\u2022 More visibility for your team: Keep your whole management team in the loop with the GFR app on their own devices.<br><br>Download the app today and keep your restaurant business booming!",
